                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Correspondence with Mr. Mason, commissioner of the
                        so-styled Confederate States of America.</hi>—<hi rendition="#italic">(In
                        continuation of papers presented to Parliament in March,</hi> 1863.)</head>
                <p rendition="#center">LIST OF PAPERS.</p>
                <p>No. 1. Mr. Mason to Earl Russell, March 2, 1863.—One enclosure.</p>
                <p>No. 2. Earl Russell to Mr. Mason, March 11, 1863.</p>
